@startuml
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
title MVC architecture and quality boundaries
footer Team 3 | 524H0072, 524H0189, 524H0188
actor "Customer / Admin / Kitchen / Shipper" as Actor
package "SaigonBite.Web | MVC 5" {
 [Razor Views and Bootstrap] as Views
 [Controllers and ViewModels] as Controllers
}
package "SaigonBite.Application" {
 [Order / Menu / Hub / Voucher Services] as Services
 [PricingService BR1-BR12 / BR14] as Pricing
 [PaymentSelector and Strategies BR13] as Payments
 [OrderTransitionService BR15-BR17] as State
 [R1 and R2 Report Services] as Reports
}
package SaigonBite.Domain {
 [Entities and immutable snapshots] as Domain
}
package SaigonBite.Infrastructure {
 [EF6 DbContext mappings and migrations] as EF
}
database "SQL Server single schema" as DB
Actor --> Views
Views --> Controllers
Controllers --> Services
Controllers --> State
Controllers --> Reports
Services --> Pricing
Services --> Payments
Services --> Domain
Services --> EF
State --> EF
Reports --> EF
EF --> Domain
EF --> DB
note bottom of Pricing
Decimal arithmetic; no HTTP/EF side effects.
Unit-testable calculation: NFR01/NFR02.
end note
note right of State
Server-side role, ownership, state and COD guards.
Atomic writes and audit: NFR04-NFR06.
end note
@enduml
